  <NAME>Renal medullary carcinomas depend upon SMARCB1 loss and are sensitive to proteasome inhibition</NAME>
  <TITLE>Renal medullary carcinomas depend upon SMARCB1 loss and are sensitive to proteasome inhibition</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>Whole gene expression arrays for primary and metastatic cell lines derived from patients with RMC Overall design: To compare patient derived RMC models with other publically available Whole Gene Expression Arrays from patients with SMARCB1 deficient cancers or other cancer cell lines.</DESCRIPTION>
